    "application_instructions": "\ud83d\udccb Official Step-by-Step Application Guide for Moroccan Students (Proc\u00e9dure de Candidature Officielle):\n\nStep 1: CSC Chinese Government Scholarship Portal Registration:\n\u2022 Go to the official CSC portal: https://studyinchina.csc.edu.cn/ (or campuschina.org).\n\u2022 Create an account and select Program Category Type B (University Program applied directly) or Type A (Embassy Bilateral via Moroccan Ministry in Rabat).\n\u2022 Enter University Agency Number (Code de l'Agence Universitaire): \u3010 10001 \u3011 (Official Agency Code for Southwest University).\n\nStep 2: University International Admissions Portal Registration:\n\u2022 Access the official university international admissions portal: https://www.campuschina.org/\n\u2022 Complete the online application dossier and choose your desired major.\n\nStep 3: Document Legalization & Sworn Translation:\n\u2022 Prepare certified sworn translations (Traduction asserment\u00e9e) of your Moroccan degrees and transcripts into English or Chinese.\n\u2022 Legalize your Foreigner Physical Examination form and Moroccan Police Clearance (Casier Judiciaire).\n\nStep 4: Department Academic Review & Online Interview:\n\u2022 The academic faculty and professors will review your dossier and conduct an online academic interview via Voov / Tencent Meeting or Zoom.\n\nStep 5: Official Admission Notice & JW201/JW202 Visa Form:\n\u2022 Successful applicants receive the official Admission Notice and JW201/JW202 Visa Certificate by DHL to Morocco.\n\u2022 Apply for your X1 Long-Term Student Visa at the Embassy of the People's Republic of China in Rabat (Souissi, Rabat).",
