    "description": "Official Chinese Government & University Scholarship for CUGB (CSC Agency Code: \u3010 10022 \u3011). Provides full academic funding for Moroccan students seeking Master / Dipl\u00f4me d'Ing\u00e9nieur degree. \n\n\ud83d\udcb0 100% Full Scholarship Coverage Package (Bourse Compl\u00e8te d'Excellence):\n\u2022 Full Tuition Waiver: 100% Free (Exon\u00e9ration totale des frais de scolarit\u00e9, valeur ~45,000 RMB/an \u2248 63,000 DH/an)\n\u2022 Free On-Campus International Student Dormitory (H\u00e9bergement universitaire gratuit en chambre individuelle ou double avec salle de bain priv\u00e9e, climatisation et Wi-Fi)\n\u2022 Monthly Living Allowance (Allocation mensuelle vers\u00e9e sur compte bancaire chinois):\n   \u2192 3,000 RMB/mois (soit environ ~4,200 Dirhams Marocains / mois net d'imp\u00f4t, total annuel: 36,000 RMB \u2248 50,400 DH)\n\u2022 Comprehensive Medical Insurance: 800 RMB/year fully paid (Assurance m\u00e9dicale compl\u00e8te tous risques Ping An)\n\u2022 Total Scholarship Value: ~93,800 RMB/an (environ ~131,320 DH/an)",
    "tuition_info": "\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Published Tuition Rates Schedule at CUGB:\n\u2022 Undergraduate (Bachelor) Sciences & Engineering: 26,000 - 32,000 RMB / year (~36,000 - 45,000 DH/an)\n\u2022 Undergraduate Humanities & Business: 24,000 - 28,000 RMB / year (~33,000 - 39,000 DH/an)\n\u2022 Master Sciences & Technology: 33,000 - 38,000 RMB / year (~46,000 - 53,000 DH/an)\n\u2022 Master Humanities & Management: 29,000 - 33,000 RMB / year (~40,000 - 46,000 DH/an)\n\u2022 Doctoral (PhD) All Disciplines: 36,000 - 48,000 RMB / year (~50,000 - 67,000 DH/an)\n\u2022 Clinical Medicine (MBBS): 45,000 - 55,000 RMB / year\n\u2b50 Under this Full Scholarship, 100% of these tuition fees are fully waived by the Chinese Government!",
    "seats_available": 7,
    "start_date": "2027-09-01",
    "end_date": "2028-07-15",
    "eligibility_criteria": "\ud83c\uddf2\ud83c\udde6 Eligibility Criteria for Moroccan Candidates (Crit\u00e8res d'\u00c9ligibilit\u00e9 pour les Candidats Marocains):\n\n1. Nationality: Holder of Moroccan Citizenship (Nationalit\u00e9 marocaine en cours de validit\u00e9).\n2. Educational Qualifications:\n   \u2022 For Master / Dipl\u00f4me d'Ing\u00e9nieur: Moroccan Baccalaureate (Baccalaur\u00e9at marocain toutes fili\u00e8res: Sciences Maths, PC, SVT, \u00c9co) or Moroccan Licence (Bac+3) / Master (Bac+5) / Dipl\u00f4me d'Ing\u00e9nieur d'\u00c9tat de l'ENCG, ENSA, FST, Facult\u00e9 des Sciences, etc.\n   \u2022 Academic Performance: Minimum GPA of 3.0/4.0 or Mention Assez Bien / Bien (Moyenne g\u00e9n\u00e9rale de 12/20 \u00e0 16/20+).\n3. Age Limits:\n   \u2022 Bachelor: Under 25 years old\n   \u2022 Master: Under 35 years old\n   \u2022 PhD: Under 40 years old\n4. Language Requirements:\n   \u2022 English-Taught Track: IELTS 6.0+, TOEFL iBT 80+, Duolingo 105+, OR Official English Proficiency Certificate from Moroccan faculty (Attestation de langue anglaise d\u00e9livr\u00e9e par l'\u00e9tablissement d'origine).\n   \u2022 Chinese-Taught Track: HSK Level 4 (180+ score) for Bachelor, HSK Level 5 (180+ score) for Master/PhD. (Note: Students without HSK can benefit from 1-Year Full Scholarship Chinese Language Foundation Year before starting degree!).",
